{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "name": "scenario-suite-p3-hedged-weekly-long",
  "description": "Experiment protocol section 13.21: the weekly low-turnover long (S-A, K and m fixed to the section 13.20 selection) alone and with a daily-reset beta hedge, either a TAIEX futures overlay (S-A-TX) or a short 0050 position (S-A-ETF, the only liquid and lendable ETF on the dataset's allowlist). No stock short book, so no execution layer. Periods P1, P2, P3 with the decision union P1+P2; P3 has been seen when this section was registered, so every number is informational. Run with one --label per predictions file (F0, F2).",
